{"seeAlsoSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/StateManagement","doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/ThemingGuide","doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/FocusSystem","doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/StatusBarGuide","doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/AppearanceAndColors","doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/Preferences","doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/CustomViews","doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/PaletteReference","doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/ListAndTable","doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/LayoutSystem","doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/ImageDecoding"],"generated":true,"title":"Guides","anchor":"Guides"}],"kind":"article","metadata":{"modules":[{"name":"TUIkit"}],"title":"Keyboard Shortcuts","roleHeading":"API Collection","role":"collectionGroup"},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/KeyboardShortcuts","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"topicSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/Key","doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/KeyEvent","doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/QuitBehavior"],"title":"Input Types","anchor":"Input-Types"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/FocusState","doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/Focusable"],"title":"Focus","anchor":"Focus"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/StatusBar","doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/StatusBarItem","doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/StatusBarItemProtocol","doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/Shortcut"],"title":"Status Bar","anchor":"Status-Bar"}],"abstract":[{"text":"How keyboard input flows through TUIkit: from raw terminal bytes to your view handlers.","type":"text"}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"anchor":"Overview","type":"heading","text":"Overview","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"TUIkit uses a layered event dispatch system. When a key is pressed, it passes through up to five layers. The first layer that consumes the event wins: remaining layers are skipped. Layer 0 (text input) and Layer 3 (focus system) are mutually exclusive: when a text input element is focused, Layer 0 runs and Layer 3 is skipped."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"identifier":"keyboard-event-dispatch.png","type":"image"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Additionally, "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Ctrl+C"},{"type":"text","text":" (SIGINT) is handled at the OS signal level "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"before","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" any of these layers: it always terminates the application."}]},{"anchor":"Available-Keys","type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Available Keys"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/Key","type":"reference"},{"text":" enum defines all keys that TUIkit can recognize from terminal input:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"anchor":"Character-Keys","type":"heading","level":3,"text":"Character Keys"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Any printable character is represented as "},{"code":".character(Character)","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":":"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"swift","code":[".onKeyPress(Key.from(\"x\")) {","    \/\/ handle \"x\" key","}"],"type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Uppercase detection: when a capital letter is typed, the resulting "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/KeyEvent","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" has "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"shift: true"},{"type":"text","text":" set automatically."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":3,"text":"Special Keys","anchor":"Special-Keys","type":"heading"},{"rows":[[[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Key","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Description"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"code":".escape","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Escape key","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":".enter"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Enter \/ Return","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"code":".tab","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Tab"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":".backspace"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Backspace \/ Delete backward"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"code":".delete","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Forward delete","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]]],"type":"table","header":"row"},{"level":3,"text":"Arrow Keys","anchor":"Arrow-Keys","type":"heading"},{"rows":[[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Key"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Description","type":"text"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":".up","type":"codeVoice"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Arrow up"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":".down"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Arrow down","type":"text"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":".left","type":"codeVoice"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Arrow left","type":"text"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":".right","type":"codeVoice"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Arrow right"}]}]]],"type":"table","header":"row"},{"level":3,"text":"Navigation Keys","anchor":"Navigation-Keys","type":"heading"},{"rows":[[[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Key","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Description"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"code":".home","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Home"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":".end"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"End"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"code":".pageUp","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Page Up"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"code":".pageDown","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Page Down","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]]],"type":"table","header":"row"},{"level":2,"text":"Key Events and Modifiers","anchor":"Key-Events-and-Modifiers","type":"heading"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/KeyEvent","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" combines a "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/Key","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" with modifier flags:"}]},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["public struct KeyEvent {","    public let key: Key","    public let ctrl: Bool     \/\/ Ctrl modifier","    public let alt: Bool      \/\/ Alt \/ Option modifier","    public let shift: Bool    \/\/ Shift modifier","}"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The terminal encodes modifiers differently from GUI frameworks:"}]},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"Ctrl+letter","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":": Detected from ASCII control codes (0x01–0x1A). For example, "},{"code":"Ctrl+C","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" produces byte "},{"code":"0x03","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Alt+key"}]},{"type":"text","text":": Detected from ESC prefix sequences ("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ESC"},{"type":"text","text":" followed by the key byte)."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Shift","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":": Only auto-detected for uppercase letters. The terminal does not send distinct shift codes for most keys.","type":"text"}]}]}]},{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Registering Key Handlers","anchor":"Registering-Key-Handlers"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Use the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".onKeyPress()"},{"type":"text","text":" modifier to handle keyboard events in your views:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"heading","level":3,"text":"Handle All Keys","anchor":"Handle-All-Keys"},{"code":["Text(\"Press any key\")","    .onKeyPress { event in","        if event.key == .enter {","            doSomething()","            return true   \/\/ consumed: stops propagation","        }","        return false      \/\/ not consumed: passes to next handler","    }"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"type":"heading","level":3,"text":"Handle Specific Keys","anchor":"Handle-Specific-Keys"},{"code":["Text(\"Use arrow keys\")","    .onKeyPress(keys: [.up, .down]) { event in","        if event.key == .up { moveUp() }","        else { moveDown() }","        return true","    }"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"type":"heading","level":3,"text":"Handle a Single Key","anchor":"Handle-a-Single-Key"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The single-key variant always consumes the event:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["Text(\"Press Enter to continue\")","    .onKeyPress(.enter) {","        continueAction()","    }"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"type":"heading","level":3,"text":"Handler Priority","anchor":"Handler-Priority"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Handlers are dispatched in "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"reverse registration order","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":": the deepest view in the tree (most recently registered) gets the event first. This means inner views can intercept events before outer views see them."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["VStack {","    Text(\"Outer\")","        .onKeyPress(.enter) {","            \/\/ Only reached if inner handler did NOT consume it","            print(\"outer enter\")","        }","    Text(\"Inner\")","        .onKeyPress(.enter) {","            \/\/ Gets the event FIRST","            print(\"inner enter\")","        }","}"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"name":"Important","type":"aside","style":"important","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"All key handlers are re-registered every render frame. If a view is not rendered (e.g. behind a conditional), its handlers are not active."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Focus Navigation","anchor":"Focus-Navigation"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The ","type":"text"},{"code":"FocusManager","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" dispatches key events in three steps:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"orderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"Focused element delegation","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":": the focused element’s "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"handleKeyEvent(_:)"},{"type":"text","text":" is called first. If it consumes the event, dispatch stops."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Tab \/ Shift+Tab"}]},{"text":": cycles focus between elements (wraps around).","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"Arrow key fallback","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":": Up\/Left move to the previous element in the section, Down\/Right move to the next. This only triggers if the focused element did not consume the arrow key in step 1."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]},{"type":"table","header":"row","rows":[[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Key"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Action"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Tab","type":"text"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Move focus to the next focusable element (wraps around)","type":"text"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Shift+Tab"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Move focus to the previous focusable element (wraps around)"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Up \/ Left"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Move to previous element in section (fallback)","type":"text"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Down \/ Right","type":"text"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Move to next element in section (fallback)"}]}]]]},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"For more details, see ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/FocusSystem"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Default Bindings","anchor":"Default-Bindings"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Layer 4 provides three built-in key bindings that work without any configuration:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"table","header":"row","rows":[[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Key"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Action"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Condition"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"q"},{"text":" \/ ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Q"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Quit application"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Only when ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/QuitBehavior"},{"text":" allows it","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"code":"t","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" \/ ","type":"text"},{"code":"T","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Cycle to next color theme","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Only when theme cycling is enabled","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"a"},{"text":" \/ ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"A"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Cycle to next appearance"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Always active"}],"type":"paragraph"}]]]},{"type":"heading","level":3,"text":"Quit Behavior","anchor":"Quit-Behavior"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/QuitBehavior","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" enum controls when ","type":"text"},{"code":"q","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" is allowed to quit:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"table","header":"row","rows":[[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Value"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Behavior"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"code":".always","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"q"},{"type":"text","text":" quits from any screen (default)"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"code":".rootOnly","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"code":"q","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" only quits when no status bar context is pushed","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]]]},{"inlineContent":[{"code":".rootOnly","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" is useful for modal dialogs: push a status bar context for the dialog, and ","type":"text"},{"code":"q","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" will be blocked until the user dismisses it:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["Dialog(title: \"Confirm\") {","    Text(\"Are you sure?\")","} footer: {","    ButtonRow {","        Button(\"Yes\") { confirm() }","        Button(\"No\") { cancel() }","    }","}",".statusBarItems(context: \"confirm-dialog\") {","    StatusBarItem(shortcut: \"y\", label: \"yes\")","    StatusBarItem(shortcut: \"n\", label: \"no\")","}"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"type":"heading","level":3,"text":"Changing the built-in quit key","anchor":"Changing-the-built-in-quit-key"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The default quit binding is configurable through ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/StatusBarState\/quitShortcut"},{"text":":","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["@Environment(\\.statusBar) private var statusBar","","statusBar.quitShortcut = .escape","statusBar.quitShortcut = .ctrlQ","statusBar.quitShortcut = QuitShortcut(","    key: .f12,","    shortcutSymbol: Shortcut.f12,","    label: \"exit\"",")"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"This changes both the Layer 4 quit binding and the displayed system item."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"heading","level":3,"text":"Overriding `q` in a local view context","anchor":"Overriding-q-in-a-local-view-context"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"A user-defined status bar item with shortcut ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"q"},{"text":" and an action intercepts the key before the default quit binding runs:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["EditorView()","    .statusBarItems {","        StatusBarItem(shortcut: \"q\", label: \"close\") {","            dismissEditor()","        }","    }"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"This is the correct way to repurpose ","type":"text"},{"code":"q","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" for a specific screen, dialog, or focus section. The matching user item handles the event in Layer 1, so Layer 4’s built-in quit binding is never reached.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Status Bar Shortcuts","anchor":"Status-Bar-Shortcuts"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The status bar displays available shortcuts to the user. Use the ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/Shortcut","isActive":true},{"text":" namespace for consistent, platform-standard symbols:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"heading","level":3,"text":"Display Symbols","anchor":"Display-Symbols"},{"code":[".statusBarItems {","    StatusBarItem(shortcut: Shortcut.arrowsUpDown, label: \"nav\")","    StatusBarItem(shortcut: Shortcut.enter, label: \"select\", key: .enter)","    StatusBarItem(shortcut: Shortcut.escape, label: \"back\")","}"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"type":"heading","level":3,"text":"Common Symbols","anchor":"Common-Symbols"},{"type":"table","header":"row","rows":[[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Symbol"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Constant"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Description"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"⎋","type":"codeVoice"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Shortcut.escape"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Escape"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"↵"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"Shortcut.enter","type":"codeVoice"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Enter"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"⇥"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"Shortcut.tab","type":"codeVoice"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Tab"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"⇤"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"Shortcut.shiftTab","type":"codeVoice"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Shift+Tab","type":"text"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"⌫","type":"codeVoice"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"Shortcut.backspace","type":"codeVoice"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Backspace","type":"text"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"⌦"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Shortcut.delete"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Delete"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"␣","type":"codeVoice"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"Shortcut.space","type":"codeVoice"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Space","type":"text"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"↑"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Shortcut.arrowUp"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Arrow up","type":"text"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"↓"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Shortcut.arrowDown"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Arrow down"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"←"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Shortcut.arrowLeft"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Arrow left"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"→","type":"codeVoice"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Shortcut.arrowRight"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Arrow right","type":"text"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"↑↓"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"Shortcut.arrowsUpDown","type":"codeVoice"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Vertical arrows","type":"text"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"←→","type":"codeVoice"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Shortcut.arrowsLeftRight"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Horizontal arrows"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"↑↓←→"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"Shortcut.arrowsAll","type":"codeVoice"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"All arrows","type":"text"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"⌃","type":"codeVoice"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Shortcut.control"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Control modifier"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"⇧"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Shortcut.shift"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Shift modifier"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"⌥","type":"codeVoice"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"Shortcut.option","type":"codeVoice"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Option \/ Alt"}]}]]]},{"type":"heading","level":3,"text":"Shortcut Helpers","anchor":"Shortcut-Helpers"},{"code":["\/\/ Combine modifier + key: \"⌃c\"","Shortcut.combine(.control, \"c\")","","\/\/ Ctrl+key display: \"^c\"","Shortcut.ctrl(\"c\")","","\/\/ Range display: \"1-9\"","Shortcut.range(\"1\", \"9\")"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"type":"heading","level":3,"text":"Common Shortcut Letters","anchor":"Common-Shortcut-Letters"},{"type":"table","header":"row","rows":[[[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Constant","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Value"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"code":"Shortcut.quit","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"q"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Shortcut.yes"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"y"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Shortcut.no"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"n"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"code":"Shortcut.cancel","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"c"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Shortcut.ok"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"code":"o","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"paragraph"}]]]},{"type":"heading","level":3,"text":"Automatic Key Matching","anchor":"Automatic-Key-Matching"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/StatusBarItem"},{"type":"text","text":" automatically derives the trigger key from the shortcut string when no explicit "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"key:"},{"type":"text","text":" parameter is given:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Symbol shortcuts ("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"⎋"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"↵"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"⇥"},{"type":"text","text":") map to their corresponding "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/TUIkit\/documentation\/TUIkit\/Key","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" values"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Single-character shortcuts ("},{"code":"\"q\"","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"code":"\"y\"","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":") map to "},{"code":".character(thatChar)","type":"codeVoice"}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Arrow combinations ("},{"code":"\"↑↓\"","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":") match "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"both","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" individual arrow keys"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Multi-character non-symbol strings are informational only (no trigger key)"}]}]}]},{"code":["\/\/ Automatic: shortcut \"q\" triggers on Key.character(\"q\")","StatusBarItem(shortcut: \"q\", label: \"quit\") { quit() }","","\/\/ Explicit: override the trigger key","StatusBarItem(shortcut: Shortcut.enter, label: \"select\", key: .enter) { select() }","","\/\/ Informational: no action, no trigger","StatusBarItem(shortcut: Shortcut.arrowsUpDown, label: \"nav\")"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Status Bar Context Stack","anchor":"Status-Bar-Context-Stack"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The status bar supports a context stack for temporary shortcut overrides: useful for modals and nested navigation:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["\/\/ Set global items",".statusBarItems {","    StatusBarItem(shortcut: Shortcut.arrowsUpDown, label: \"nav\")","    StatusBarItem(shortcut: Shortcut.enter, label: \"select\", key: .enter)","}","","\/\/ Push context-specific items (e.g. for a dialog)",".statusBarItems(context: \"my-dialog\") {","    StatusBarItem(shortcut: \"y\", label: \"yes\") { confirm() }","    StatusBarItem(shortcut: \"n\", label: \"no\") { cancel() }","}"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"When a context is pushed, its items replace the global items in the display. System items (quit, theme, appearance) remain visible unless a user item uses the same shortcut string."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"heading","level":3,"text":"System Items","anchor":"System-Items"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Three system items are shown by default:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"table","header":"row","rows":[[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"